  m_text: "-------------------------\r\nMade for CCNY's Digital Game Development
    Program\r\nSenior Project \u2014 Fall 2025 / Spring 2026\r\n\r\n-------------------------\r\n<b><size=120%>PRODUCTION
    & DESIGN</size></b>\r\n\r\n<b>Ryan Zhao</b>\r\nProducer / Narrative Lead / Design
    Lead\r\n\r\n<b>Neo Randall</b>\r\nLevel Designer / Systems Lead\r\n\r\n<b>Elikson
    Rodriguez</b>\r\nLevel Designer\r\n\r\n<b>Du Lam</b>\r\nLevel Designer / Narrative
    Designer\r\n\r\n<b>Angel Martinez</b>\r\nAudio Lead / Level Designer\r\n\r\n-------------------------\r\n<b><size=120%>ART</size></b>\r\n\r\n<b>Matthew
    Kotkin</b>\r\nArt Lead\r\n\r\n<b>Richard Nguyen</b>\r\n2D/3D Artist\r\n\r\n<b>Sandra
    Saeteros</b>\r\n2D/3D Artist\r\n\r\n<b>Joanna Dammacco-Charles</b>\r\n3D Artist\r\n\r\n<b>Lily
    Cheng</b>\r\nTech Artist / 3D Artist\r\n\r\n<b>Rey Lefebvre</b>\r\n3D Artist\r\n\r\n<b>Kay
    Thomas</b>\r\nAdditional Art\r\n\r\n-------------------------\r\n<b><size=120%>UX/UI</size></b>\r\n\r\n<b>Wilfreddy
    Suarez</b>\r\nUX/UI Designer + Artist / 3D Texturer\r\n\r\n<b>Leighton Snyder</b>\r\nUX/UI
    Designer + Artist\r\n\r\n-------------------------\r\n<b><size=120%>PROGRAMMING</size></b>\r\n\r\n<b>Manny
    Patrick Vivas</b>\r\nLead Programmer\r\n\r\n<b>Joshua Nunez</b>\r\nProgrammer\r\n\r\n<b>Emmanuel
    Guerrero</b>\r\nProgrammer\r\n\r\n<b>Sarah Stephens</b>\r\nProgrammer\r\n\r\n<b>Wiktor
    Kolakowski</b>\r\nUI/UX Programmer + 2D/3D Animator\r\n\r\n-------------------------\r\n<b><size=120%>FACULTY</size></b>\r\n\r\n<b>Misha
    Favorov</b>\r\nProfessor\r\n\r\n<b>Tasneen Bashir</b>\r\nProfessor\r\n\r\n-------------------------\r\nThank
    you for playing!\r\n!"
